# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with the default core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# every text file to CRLF on checkout. Nothing breaks loudly -- but the queue
# format is specified as LF (docs/QUEUE-FORMAT.md), and src/lib/diff.js exists
# partly because CRLF-vs-LF is the single most common source of false
# differences when comparing two sources of the same value.
#
# A repository that documents that trap should not ship it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary

# Language stats (GitHub Linguist): keep the badge honest about this being a QA
# automation project, not a Solidity one. Vendored and generated files are
# excluded from the language breakdown; the hand-written test code is not.
contracts/lib/**                                linguist-vendored
**/package-lock.json                            linguist-generated
**/*.xlsx                                        linguist-generated
fixtures/testcases.json                         linguist-generated
testcases/*-TestCases.md                        linguist-generated
